==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Log]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Log]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Log]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

